},{"id":1327318271,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzI3MzE4Mjcx","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/crash","name":"crash","color":"885544","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/24","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24/labels","id":14236899,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A2Tzj","number":24,"title":"4.7","description":"","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2535,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-11-27T20:29:18Z","updated_at":"2026-10-20T18:39:31Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-06-19T16:54:35Z"},"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-02-12T03:48:49Z","updated_at":"2026-02-16T16:26:51Z","closed_at":"2026-02-16T16:24:56Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproducible in custom build of master (some just-fixed issues stepped in before this issue has a chance to reveal itself in stable builds).\n\n### System information\n\nUbuntu 22.04.5 LTS 22.04 on X11 - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4060 Laptop GPU - 13th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i9-13900HX (32 threads) - 31.03 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen there are threaded nodes, enabling physics interpolation could randomly crash the engine. The probability of crashing increases when the number of threaded nodes increase.\n\nWith standard, production builds, the engine crashes with a single line of message ranging from (but not necessarily limited to):\n\n- malloc(): invalid size (unsorted)\n- double free or corruption (out)\n- corrupted size vs. prev_size\n- realloc(): invalid next size\n\nThe custom crash handler did not have a chance to opt-in. This message is printed in the allocation functions of glibc (they abort()-ed right after that, I guess).\n\nThis clearly indicates a nasty heap corruption. Most likely due to some wild writes that did not trigger SEGV immediately.\n\n### Note\n\nIn stable releases, this issue could have been hidden by more prominent issues of the process group mechanism. This new issue is reproduced with [PR#116000](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116000) and [PR#116012](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116012) already applied.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nRun the scene in the MRP.\n\nThe MRP contains 64 threaded rotating boxes in one scene. On my computer this would almost certainly result in an immediate crash.\n\nI made [PR#116192](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116192) to address this, technical inspection and break down would be given in the PR.\n\nThe scene in MRP:\n\n<img width=\"807\" height=\"602\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0ef0579a-fee2-4912-aba0-517fd54f0e6d\" />\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[threaded_fti.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/25249765/threaded_fti.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116191/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116191/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}